{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2021-08-18 17:28:00', 'title': 'NEW ENGLAND JOURNAL OF MEDICINE PUBLISHES 12-WEEK RESULTS FROM STUDY EVALUATING ATOGEPANT FOR THE PREVENTIVE TREATMENT OF MIGRAINE', 'text': 'NORTH CHICAGO, ILL., AUG. 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ABBVIE (NYSE: ABBV) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE NEW ENGLAND JOURNAL OF MEDICINE (NEJM)\xa0HAS PUBLISHED 12-WEEK RESULTS FROM THE PHASE 3 ADVANCE TRIAL EVALUATING ATOGEPANT FOR THE PREVENTIVE TREATMENT OF MIGRAINE IN ADULTS WHO MEET CRITERIA FOR EPISODIC MIGRAINE.'}